{"message":"I have the TechWorld Electronics dispute details. Since this was an in-store physical-card transaction you did not make, I’ll classify it as card-present fraud. Before filing, please confirm:

1. Do you still have the physical card that was used for this transaction?
2. Was your PIN possibly observed or skimmed, shared with someone, or are you unsure? Reply with “yes_observed,” “yes_shared,” or “unknown.”"}
